    "detailed_description": "<h1>Eng Announcement Test</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud14d\uc2a4\ud2b8 \ud615\uc2dd \uacf5\uc9c0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English Announcement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879020/extras/f0dbd9b72c0997b0f7db2b69ff810d20.avif?t=1752165669\" width=640 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879020/extras/e609fe661819d495226f96f69c629fcd.avif?t=1752165669\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AVOID GAME</strong> \u2013 A Fast-Paced Dodge Action Challenge!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a nimble <strong>green square</strong> and test your reflexes in this <strong>fast-paced survival game</strong>! Your mission? <strong>Dodge an endless barrage</strong> of falling <strong>orange and gray squares</strong> that drop at different speeds and patterns. The longer you survive, the harder it gets\u2014can you outlast the chaos?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple, Addictive Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Easy to learn, but hard to master! Move your green square using simple controls to dodge the incoming hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Difficulty Scaling</strong> \u2013 As time passes, the falling squares <strong>increase in speed and density</strong>, keeping you on your toes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Survival Mode</strong> \u2013 No levels, no competition\u2014just you versus the ever-intensifying challenge. <strong>How long can you last?</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Visual Style</strong> \u2013 Clean and simple pixel art ensures a smooth experience, letting you focus purely on the action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Action</strong> \u2013 No waiting, no menus\u2014the game throws you into the action immediately. Every run is a fresh challenge!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to test your reflexes? Challenge yourself in AVOID GAME and see how long you can survive!</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AVOID GAME</strong> \u2013 A Fast-Paced Dodge Action Challenge!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a nimble <strong>green square</strong> and test your reflexes in this <strong>fast-paced survival game</strong>! Your mission? <strong>Dodge an endless barrage</strong> of falling <strong>orange and gray squares</strong> that drop at different speeds and patterns. The longer you survive, the harder it gets\u2014can you outlast the chaos?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple, Addictive Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Easy to learn, but hard to master! Move your green square using simple controls to dodge the incoming hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Difficulty Scaling</strong> \u2013 As time passes, the falling squares <strong>increase in speed and density</strong>, keeping you on your toes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Survival Mode</strong> \u2013 No levels, no competition\u2014just you versus the ever-intensifying challenge. <strong>How long can you last?</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Visual Style</strong> \u2013 Clean and simple pixel art ensures a smooth experience, letting you focus purely on the action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Action</strong> \u2013 No waiting, no menus\u2014the game throws you into the action immediately. Every run is a fresh challenge!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to test your reflexes? Challenge yourself in AVOID GAME and see how long you can survive!</strong></h2>",
    "short_description": "AVOID GAME is a simple yet addictive dodge action game! Control a green square and avoid falling orange and gray squares. The longer you survive, the harder it gets! With easy controls, endless survival, and rising difficulty, challenge your reflexes and set a new record!",
